  "title": "Evaluate a formula at three points",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Evaluate a formula at three points",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "A rank-one F64 Array is evaluated element by element: x^2+1 at [-2,0,3] gives [5,1,10]. No shape or point is manufactured.\n\nA rank-one F64 Array is evaluated element by element: x^2+1 at [-2,0,3] gives [5,1,10]. No shape or point is manufactured.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.formula.evaluation@1; compiled owned-value service.\nExpected:\noutput-y_values (array<f64>) = [5,1,10]\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
